Z||000000||AkursedX||07-28-2001||04:55 PM||||Hi guys.  I just wanted to tell people that I bought another Fiero!!!  It's a black 1987 GT w/ grey interior. It's an auto though, not that I'm complaining, and it has 82k miles.<P>Options:<BR>Sunroof<BR>air<BR>power mirrors/windows<BR>and I think that's it....<P>I bought it for $400 dollars because it "blows oil"  and it just got dinged and messed up a little bit of the door and the quarterpanel.  The paint is rough, and I probably will paint it.  <P>As for the blowing oil, it's only the oil pressure sending unit, and that's a nice cheap fix, and it needs new brakes all around.  <P>So, I think I got a pretty good deal.  Yeah it's worn, but it'll only be my winter car.  <P>By the way, I will be selling the black wing that comes with it.  I like how it looks without it much better  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Pics to come on Wednesday  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
